course: dictionary
lesson: 13477
title: Hypocrite
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A hypocrite is someone who says others should behave well but does not behave that way themselves. Their words and their actions do not match. «Sam told his sister, "Never tell lies," then he told a big lie about the cake.» Sam is a hypocrite because he preached honesty but was not honest himself.
explain: The word can also mean someone who pretends to be good when they are not. «Mrs Hart smiled sweetly at everyone, but behind their backs she said cruel things.» The smiling is the pretending. The cruel talk shows what she is really like.
explain: Be careful: a hypocrite is not just someone who makes a mistake, because everybody gets things wrong sometimes. Hypocrisy is when someone expects good behaviour from others while ignoring it themselves. A good check is to ask: do this person's actions match what they say?
fact: Hypocrite is a noun: one hypocrite, and more than one is hypocrites.
fact: «Hypocrite» means a person who says others should behave well but does not behave that way themselves.
fact: «Hypocrite» can also mean someone who pretends to be good when they are not.
fact: In the Bible, Jesus called some religious leaders hypocrites for praying to be seen rather than from the heart.
fact: Phrases to know: a hypocrite, call someone a hypocrite, don't be a hypocrite.
exercise: «Sam told his sister, "Never tell lies," then he told a lie about the cake.» Why is Sam a hypocrite? | *He says others should be honest but is not honest himself | He is always honest and kind to his sister | He tells lies only to his friends | He does not like cake
exercise: What does hypocrite mean? | A person who is very tall | A person who loves to cook | A person who tells the truth every time | *A person whose actions do not match their words
exercise: Ben tells his friends not to be rude, then he laughs at them and is rude himself. Which word fits Ben best? | *hypocrite | sleepy | curious | generous
test: The coach shouted, "Stop cheating!" then he cheated in the race himself. What is the coach? | A runner | A winner | A referee | *A hypocrite
test: Which sentence uses hypocrite correctly? | *She is a hypocrite, because she says sharing matters but never shares. | She is a hypocrite, because she likes apples. | She is a hypocrite, because it is raining. | She is a hypocrite, because she is very tall.
exam: Someone says «Always be kind» but is unkind to his own brother. Which word describes him best? | A champion | A stranger | A hero | *A hypocrite
